Z","closed_at":"2026-09-01T18:32:20Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120912","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120912","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120912.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120912.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-01T18:32:20Z"},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThis sets up [macro benchmarking](https://developer.android.com/topic/performance/benchmarking/benchmarking-overview#macrobenchmark) for the Android editor. This will allow us to measure and keep an eye on the editor startup and interaction performance.\r\n\r\nAt the moment, the benchmark is set to measure startup timing, memory usage and frame timing when launching the project manager and when launching the editor for an empty project.\r\n\r\nRemaining TODO in follow-up PRs:\r\n- [ ]  Configure CI to automatically run the benchmark based on instructions from https://developer.android.com/topic/performance/benchmarking/benchmarking-in-ci\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nSupersedes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105553\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributi